<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daelim Ind 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Daelim Ind 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				     691 vs 749</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	   in cash   common shares		1 vs 2</p>
<p>			 preferred shares	   2 vs 3</p>
<p>	   in stock				   4 vs 3</p>
<p>    Turnover				    247.7 vs 221.6</p>
<p>    Net					    22.9 vs  20.8</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			  34.3 vs  51.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinary loss			 32.7 vs 25.9</p>
<p>    Div Register				 Dec 31</p>
<p>    Div Pay					April 11</p>
<p>Note - Daelim Industrial Co Ltd, a construction company, said its share capital rose by 1.43 million shares in 1996 to 37.3 million.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
